{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve containment when every clock sample stalls**\n\nSelecting the midpoint leaves up to half the smallest sampling window as epoch error. When all three samples are interrupted, ordinary user spans can consequently escape their SDK parents; the added fixture observes a \u00b15 ms residual and skips containment assertions in those cases. Retain the bracket endpoints and derive conservative lower-bound starts and upper-bound ends, then require containment in every stalled fixture.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77Hfct","finding_digest":"eb83580fb6c6151f56b816d070253ecd2eea42747ad77dfe9353b102e28878f5","finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","line":25,"observation_digest":"e08241b70750e05862223566a5645ff01ee71cd8ec6ee7e534f1e21d66d5edac","observation_id":"aro_v1_4cbednyhkdqfqyrcgvtkkzc76a","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:25:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_7mc26unvhshyyalgxwhwjm7nhe","reviewed_base_sha":"19ee19fa0619093943f079b69943f7b5cdee7ac7","reviewed_head_sha":"b3f06d77f0045df90e48b5920fef53480d575fa2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":25,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":962},"record_id":"art_v1_umedhtair454mbp5gi2j5jdlkp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:25:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
